Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Warning,,0,0,0,,{\fscx0\fscy0\clip(0,0,0,0)\org(0,0)}Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode.\NSubtitles will likely not function properly.\NPlease use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv:\Nhttps://mpv.io
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:02:03.19,Warning,,0,0,0,,{\fscx0\fscy0\clip(0,0,0,0)\org(0,0)}Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode.\NSubtitles will likely not function properly.\NPlease use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv:\Nhttps://mpv.io
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.56,0:01:58.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.86,0:02:01.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWell, if we catch it, we can\Nteach it how to pull the ship!
Comment: 0,0:01:59.86,0:02:01.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we can teach it how\Nto pull the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.73,0:02:03.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NLike hell we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.93,0:02:06.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd tell you to take a good look\Nat it, but it's so ridiculously huge,
Comment: 0,0:02:05.46,0:02:06.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it's so ridiculously huge,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.73,0:02:09.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know how in the world\Nyou could miss the damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.02,0:02:11.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that is big.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.26,0:02:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.05,0:02:15.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NIt must've been here for centuries!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.39,0:02:18.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The kraken shows up in myths\Nfrom all over the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.21,0:02:22.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's one of the most terrible\Nmonsters that ever lived!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.53,0:02:27.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have any bones,\Nand I am only bones...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.45,0:02:28.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.45,0:02:30.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it enjoys\Nmaking no-skull jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.95,0:02:33.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I doubt it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.55,0:02:35.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NHey, you're a pretty good artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:38.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanted to capture\Nthe moment on paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.03,0:02:40.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drawing pictures?! Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.06,0:02:43.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll help you out.\NYou've got a plan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:47.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Problem is, there's not\Nmuch we can do underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.03,0:02:49.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:52.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The problem is,\Nthe thing's gigantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.81,0:02:55.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We couldn't even take it\Non above sea level.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:58.15,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU]\NWhat is wrong with these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.15,0:03:01.98,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Anybody in their right mind\Nwould've run for the hills by now!
Comment: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:01.98,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,would've run for the hills by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.98,0:03:04.49,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What's taking them\Nso long to decide?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.49,0:03:06.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're leaving!\NShift the helm due south!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:09.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami! Let's go\Nstraight toward it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.65,0:03:11.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NDon't be stupid! That thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.36,0:03:15.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NIt's okay, Nami. I'm here for y...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.19,0:03:17.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here for...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:21.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.30,0:03:24.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You held it in! Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:25.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We made him all better!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:27.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it helps that Nami\Nput on a coat, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.97,0:03:29.71,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU]\NI'm not safe on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.71,0:03:31.60,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll have to protect myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:34.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somethin's coming up behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.15,0:03:35.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SURUME roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.31,0:03:36.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:38.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CORIBOU]\NBrother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.99,0:03:40.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThese guys again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.32,0:03:43.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! I'm so happy you\Ncame back for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.32,0:03:45.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's rush in there\Nand rescue my bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.76,0:03:47.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU PIRATES]\N– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.23,0:03:50.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the best crew\Na captain could ask for!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.90,0:03:58.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.67,0:04:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER, USOPP, BROOK scream]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.11,0:04:04.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NIt destroyed the coating!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.01,0:04:06.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThat ship's bigger than the {\i1}Sunny{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.25,0:04:11.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! They didn't make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:16.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[CARIBOU cries]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:21.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like jellyfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.63,0:04:24.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit, Roronoa!\NThat's too cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:28.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHere it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.54,0:04:32.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's so huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.07,0:04:34.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can fight\Nagainst a monster like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.97,0:04:36.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Now, Third Gear...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:38.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:41.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you do that, you'll break\Nthe bubble for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.15,0:04:47.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,175)}Chicken... Voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.05,0:04:49.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't we... Ah!... escape somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:52.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, let me take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.09,0:04:53.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:55.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you pop the bubble,\Nthen we all die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:57.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The little fellow's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.10,0:04:59.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if you wanna face\Nthe kraken that badly,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.60,0:05:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I might just have\Nthe idea for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:05.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine, what is it?\NMake it snappy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.81,0:05:08.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There! Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.41,0:05:11.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That contraption is called\Nthe Flutter Kick Coating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.51,0:05:14.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's an extravehicular\Ndiving suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.25,0:05:16.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as you stay inside it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.15,0:05:19.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you can fight underwater\Nas much as you need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.25,0:05:20.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pretty amazing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:25.09,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU]\NIf I let them call the shots, we'll\Nall go to hell in a handbasket.
Comment: 0,0:05:23.09,0:05:25.09,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,we'll all go to hell\Nin a handbasket.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.09,0:05:27.33,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you weren't\Nsupposed to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.33,0:05:29.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rest of us wanted\Nto get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:32.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now they're gonna stay and\Ntry to fight that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.20,0:05:35.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been telling you all to run\Naway from the beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.03,0:05:38.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but your fearless leader was\Nhaving none of that, now was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:41.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think of it this way, would you\Nrather have them fight it outside
Comment: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:41.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,would you rather have\Nthem fight it outside
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:42.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or fight it right here\Non the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:44.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right! You guys get out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.84,0:05:45.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Far, far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.78,0:05:47.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This rope's kinda annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.31,0:05:49.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Remember to stay as far\Nfrom the ship as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:51.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.85,0:05:53.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.49,0:05:54.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.96,0:05:58.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.12,0:06:00.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys forgot\Nthe safety ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.73,0:06:03.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get separated!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.16,0:06:06.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds like Nami's\Nworried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:07.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.67,0:06:09.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need both of you guys\Nto distract him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:12.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I can get one good punch off,\NI think I can take him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.17,0:06:15.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't I just slice him\Nto pieces? It'd be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.14,0:06:17.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause that wouldn't\Ndo me any good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:20.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna capture him\Nand keep him as a pet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.80,0:06:23.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NCareful, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.05,0:06:25.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and keep your distance!\N'Cause every centimeter counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.93,0:06:27.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH scream]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.47,0:06:29.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NOkay, that was way too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.82,0:06:33.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.30,0:06:34.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Franky...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.91,0:06:36.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.22,0:06:37.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.80,0:06:40.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Rocket Launcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:43.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NGot 'im!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:45.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NThat was incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.34,0:06:46.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH scream]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.42,0:06:48.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.77,0:06:50.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many arms does it have?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.48,0:06:52.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gonna hit us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.96,0:06:54.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Guard Point!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.27,0:06:57.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! It hit the ship pretty hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.51,0:07:00.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NEveryone okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:03.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHe... He saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.14,0:07:04.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.18,0:07:06.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice one, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:11.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're about to be\Ncrushed against that mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.04,0:07:14.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[gasps] Now, Mil Fleurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.17,0:07:16.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gigantesco Mano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:19.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ALL screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.68,0:07:22.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, those hands are big!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.51,0:07:23.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[gasps]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.31,0:07:26.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(623,1053)\q2}– [FRANKY] Yeah!\N– [CHOPPER] Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:28.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice one, Robin!\NThat was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.80,0:07:30.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:31.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.26,0:07:33.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was only in the water\Nfor the briefest moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.77,0:07:35.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so my power held out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.75,0:07:39.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, guess it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:44.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Third Gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.44,0:08:03.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Armament Hardening!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:08.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.74,0:08:12.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So tough underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:13.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.21,0:08:16.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.32,0:08:18.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like that octopus\Nis gonna wait patiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.77,0:08:20.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Blue Walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:23.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. Sanji just\Nleft his bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:25.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's fast even in the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.87,0:08:28.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like a Fishman! So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.89,0:08:33.08,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I spent two years running\Nfrom those monsters on that island.
Comment: 0,0:08:31.36,0:08:33.08,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,on that island.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.08,0:08:36.99,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,And the first thing I do is\Nrun straight at another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.99,0:08:40.87,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,But all things considered,\Nthis one's a bit cuter, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.87,0:08:43.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Diable Jambe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:51.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bien Cuit... Grill Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:58.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[roars]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.27,0:09:04.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Three-Sword Style...\NCrossing the Six Paths!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.85,0:09:16.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, were you two\Nnot listenin' to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:18.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you not to cut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.78,0:09:23.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}My turn! Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:25.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Elephant Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.44,0:09:31.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[yelling]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.75,0:09:32.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:34.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He blew it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.11,0:09:35.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.09,0:09:37.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What kind of training did\NLuffy go through?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.44,0:09:44.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.16,0:09:45.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.13,0:09:46.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OTHERS]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.91,0:09:48.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NIt's a shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.07,0:09:55.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:09:57.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why is that\Nshark wearing a shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:09:59.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not to mention it's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:07.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[LUFFY yelling]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.56,0:10:14.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're being swept away\Nby the downward current!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.87,0:10:17.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWe can't get split up\Ndown here! Follow them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.42,0:10:18.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NRight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.46,0:10:21.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[STRAW HATS screaming]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.76,0:10:24.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NI don't wanna die down\Nhere! It's dark and wet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.36,0:10:25.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU]\NWould you fools pull it together?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.93,0:10:26.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NForgot that dude was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.83,0:10:28.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you panicking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.17,0:10:29.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[CHOPPER screaming]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:30.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NIf I had a stomach,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.80,0:10:33.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I would be voiding its\Ncontents right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.07,0:10:38.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep the yard level, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.98,0:10:40.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turn hard to port!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.39,0:10:42.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we're gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.74,0:10:44.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.65,0:10:47.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NDon't let up for a second\Nor the ship's a goner!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.94,0:10:52.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's keep it\Ntogether, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.27,0:10:55.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay in the center\Nof the current!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.55,0:10:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doin' my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:03.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NIt's way too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.46,0:11:05.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[LUFFY laughs]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.03,0:11:06.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:15.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[laughing]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.14,0:11:20.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.04,0:11:22.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! What a headache!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.61,0:11:23.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.98,0:11:26.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But at least we made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.15,0:11:27.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:32.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Why're you\Nall making such long faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:36.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm awake now, so\Nthere's nothing for you to fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.13,0:11:40.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NMan, is it freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:44.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Zoro, and Sanji have gone\Nmissing. They're lost in the sea.
Comment: 0,0:11:42.94,0:11:44.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're lost in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:45.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.34,0:11:49.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The best we can do now is hope\Nthe monster didn't tear them apart.
Comment: 0,0:11:47.78,0:11:49.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,didn't tear them apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:51.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NGlad you're being optimistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.79,0:11:53.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHow are we supposed to find them
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.23,0:11:55.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when we can't even see\Nwhat's in front of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:11:57.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NI don't like being in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.78,0:12:01.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It feels like something could\Nattack us from any direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:05.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NThe best I can guess is we've\Ndescended about 7,000 meters.
Comment: 0,0:12:03.02,0:12:05.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,about 7,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:08.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even the {\i1}Shark Submerge{\i0} can't\Nsustain this level of pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.25,0:12:10.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHow close are we\Nto Fishman Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.59,0:12:13.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe the others have\Nalready made it there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.43,0:12:14.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NProbably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.76,0:12:18.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,According to Camie, it's\N10,000 meters below sea level.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.80,0:12:21.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NAnd we have 3,000 more to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:24.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those guys each have\Na bubble and that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:28.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if they are somehow still\Nalive, they'll need more air!
Comment: 0,0:12:26.44,0:12:28.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they'll need more air!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.17,0:12:30.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,None of this would've happened\Nif they used the safety ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.84,0:12:32.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Freakin' out's not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.95,0:12:34.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.31,0:12:36.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can look for 'em\Nwith my new searchlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:37.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.95,0:12:41.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does it shine from your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.31,0:12:42.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:43.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:45.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.11,0:12:47.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}[FRANKY]\NFranky Nipple Lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.42,0:12:49.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did they have to be there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.74,0:12:53.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[STRAW HATS screaming]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.94,0:12:56.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NLet's get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.01,0:13:07.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.73,0:13:10.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where in the world\Nhave you guys gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.44,0:13:12.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need you all back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.58,0:13:15.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This place is so vast,\Nand we're so far down,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.36,0:13:17.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sunny's eyes are\Npractically useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.64,0:13:20.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NI feel so helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.35,0:13:24.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can barely see. It's no\Nwonder that everyone is on edge.
Comment: 0,0:13:21.87,0:13:24.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no wonder that\Neveryone is on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.35,0:13:26.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a better\Nway to tackle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.89,0:13:29.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You ladies got any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.47,0:13:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep searching and\Njust hope for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.62,0:13:33.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't stop the ship right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.09,0:13:39.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NUh! Look, a jellyfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.36,0:13:41.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like we're inside it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.01,0:13:45.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's huge! It feels like\Nit could swallow us whole!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.16,0:13:46.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And they're twinkling!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.67,0:13:49.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like a starry sky,\Nwherever they go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.65,0:13:52.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps] They're so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.43,0:13:54.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa. That's one long tentacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:57.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You, uh, wanna shake\Nhands and be friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:14:00.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't touch it!\NIt's probably venomous!
Comment: 0,0:13:59.23,0:14:00.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's probably venomous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.73,0:14:02.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.31,0:14:07.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:10.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}No choice! Coup de Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.55,0:14:15.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.55,0:14:17.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It ate that big jellyfish whole!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.65,0:14:21.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh. Not to mention, we lost\Nsome air in that maneuver.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.62,0:14:23.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NIt was better than the alternative!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.46,0:14:24.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.40,0:14:25.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.58,0:14:28.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Coup de Burst sucks\Nin air to make a quick launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.39,0:14:33.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thing is, 'cause we're underwater,\Nits only resource is our air supply.
Comment: 0,0:14:30.47,0:14:33.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,its only resource\Nis our air supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.22,0:14:37.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So obviously, when we use it,\Nour bubble shrinks a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.14,0:14:40.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.77,0:14:43.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fish that attacked it\Nturned upside down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.27,0:14:45.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NA neurotoxin. I figured as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.11,0:14:46.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.11,0:14:50.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's awful down here!\NAnd dark! It's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.31,0:14:55.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All these creepy creatures\Nwith their freaky eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.14,0:15:01.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because the sea's so dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.12,0:15:04.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,many of the animals that live\Ndown here have poor eyesight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.70,0:15:06.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER, USOPP sigh]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.28,0:15:08.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NSo they can't see\Nany better than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.46,0:15:13.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Losers! Where ya lookin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.10,0:15:16.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NHowever, there are some that have\Nhighly developed eyes as well.
Comment: 0,0:15:14.53,0:15:16.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,highly developed eyes as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.29,0:15:18.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER, USOPP screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.74,0:15:23.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? You're curious as to how I\Ncan see when I don't have eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.09,0:15:24.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.30,0:15:26.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But do you really want\Nto know the answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.37,0:15:29.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drum roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.04,0:15:31.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[imitates drumming]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.84,0:15:33.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.55,0:15:37.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brook. Why is it you're\Nalways talkin' to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.02,0:15:40.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a habit that comes\Nfrom being lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.88,0:15:43.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough! Quit fooling around!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.56,0:15:44.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(735.5,1053)\q2}– {\i1}[thud]{\i0}\N– {\i1}[BROOK grunts]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.23,0:15:44.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(730.5,1053)\q2}– {\i1}[thud]{\i0}\N– {\i1}[USOPP grunts]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.93,0:15:46.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(702.5,1053)\q2}– {\i1}[thud]{\i0}\N– {\i1}[CHOPPER grunts]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:48.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No more violence, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:51.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH]\N– Luffy! Zoro! Sanji!\N– Luffy! Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:55.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH]\N– Help us. Nami is scary.\N– Help us. Nami is scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:57.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NWhat's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.61,0:15:59.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.58,0:16:01.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.11,0:16:02.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.45,0:16:05.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NHave any of you seen the pirate\Nwho boarded the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.52,0:16:09.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NOh, yeah, I forgot about him. I'm\Nsure he's around here somewhere.
Comment: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:09.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's around\Nhere somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.95,0:16:11.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NBut where is somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.39,0:16:14.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him for a while.\NNot since we descended.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:17.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NDo you think he might've been thrown\Noff when everything went crazy?
Comment: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:17.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when everything went crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Totally possible. I mean,\Nhis arms and legs were tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.69,0:16:22.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way he could\Nhold on to anything
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.27,0:16:23.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,while we were rockin' around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:26.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NNormally, I'd agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:28.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it seems that he\Nfreed himself. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.70,0:16:29.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER, USOPP]\N– Huh?!\N– Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:31.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.39,0:16:36.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NSo that drippy weirdo\Nescaped and he's... still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.07,0:16:38.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gotta be waiting\Nfor the right moment to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:41.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:42.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.14,0:16:43.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:44.73,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU]\NIf you're so eager to see me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.73,0:16:48.15,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to sneak into your\Nroom tonight, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:50.56,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it! We got enough problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.56,0:16:53.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't need this guy givin' us\None more thing to worry about!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:54.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.88,0:16:57.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not like he's an actual\Nthreat to any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.70,0:16:58.93,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.94,0:17:01.32,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU]\NThat's right, you think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.32,0:17:04.07,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll see how wrong you are\Nnow that the three morons
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.07,0:17:07.18,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,who could put up a fight have\Ngotten themselves killed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.18,0:17:10.36,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,fighting that kraken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:12.64,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, there's no\Nway they've survived
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.64,0:17:14.82,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,getting sucked down into\Nthe bowels of the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.82,0:17:17.63,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,with just those tiny bubbles\Nto protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.63,0:17:19.74,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU]\NOh, what a shame that\NI didn't have the chance
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:22.35,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,to kill Straw Hat\Nwith my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.35,0:17:24.36,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,But no one will ever\Ndoubt that he's dead
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.36,0:17:27.21,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,once I come back with the rest\Nof his crew members' heads
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.21,0:17:29.76,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,in tow as my personal trophies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.76,0:17:30.92,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,No one at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.93,0:17:33.37,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.38,0:17:37.27,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU]\NMm-hmm. But I can't get too\Nexcited. There's no need to rush.
Comment: 0,0:17:35.69,0:17:37.27,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no need to rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.27,0:17:40.89,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,If I killed them all now, there wouldn't\Nbe anyone left to sail the ship,
Comment: 0,0:17:38.65,0:17:40.89,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,there wouldn't be anyone\Nleft to sail the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.89,0:17:42.50,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,and then what would I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:46.56,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,So I'll let them live for now, while\Nthey can still be useful to me.
Comment: 0,0:17:44.15,0:17:46.56,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,while they can still\Nbe useful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:49.07,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Once we land on Fishman\NIsland, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.07,0:17:52.34,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna slaughter you\Ndown to the last man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.35,0:17:54.69,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.18,0:17:59.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I found him, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.91,0:18:02.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU]\NHey! Knock it off, dammit!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.15,0:18:04.62,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I wasn't doing\Nanything bad, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.65,0:18:06.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's see him break outta that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.22,0:18:08.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did he even manage\Nto get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.82,0:18:10.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because we weren't\Npaying attention to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.93,0:18:13.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he weren't so stupid,\Nwe could've been in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:17.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His body was like a big mass of goo\Nin there. It didn't have a real shape.
Comment: 0,0:18:16.06,0:18:17.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It didn't have a real shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:18.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So he was like a pile of mud?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.93,0:18:22.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NYeah, if I had to guess,\Nit's a devil fruit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.07,0:18:24.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Most likely a Logia-type\Nfruit at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.74,0:18:26.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was giving us a false\Nsense of security,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:28.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'cause he could've\Nescaped at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.86,0:18:31.66,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU]\NGet me outta here!\NI'll behave, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.67,0:18:33.08,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,You, in the banana hammock!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.09,0:18:35.62,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,If you let me out,\NI'll be your servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:36.97,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.46,0:18:41.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? You feelin' all\Nright, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.78,0:18:45.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dunno. It just\Ngot really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.32,0:18:48.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't stand the heat. I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.90,0:18:51.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sheesh! It is warmer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.38,0:18:54.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh! Wait a second.\NIs that smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.23,0:18:56.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't see what's\Nin front of us through that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.10,0:19:01.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Smoke underwater? Can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.07,0:19:03.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Actually, it can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.64,0:19:04.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:12.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hydrothermal deposits!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.02,0:19:12.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:15.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep up! This is\Na volcanic area!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.52,0:19:16.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.49,0:19:17.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYes, for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.82,0:19:19.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can see where\Nthere've been eruptions!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.96,0:19:21.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NWe have to get outta here, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.83,0:19:24.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If one of those erupts,\Nwe're as good as dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.96,0:19:27.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hot. I'm so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.63,0:19:32.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NThere's something coming after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.47,0:19:34.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's carnivorous tubeworms!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.30,0:19:35.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.61,0:19:38.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Small one. Coup de Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:41.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH scream]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.01,0:19:44.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NFaceless crabs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.28,0:19:46.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[FRANKY]\NHave to risk it again.\NCoup de Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.55,0:19:47.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ALL scream]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:50.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NI don't even know what\Nthe hell those things are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.05,0:19:52.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Hang on, guys! Coup de Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:55.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NThe sea is awful! I hate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.83,0:20:00.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way the others can\Nsurvive down here on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.16,0:20:01.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe\Nthis is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.97,0:20:03.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we'd only just\Ngotten back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.90,0:20:07.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop crying! Those three\Nare way too tough to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.50,0:20:10.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Even using the Coup\Nde Burst that sparingly,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.41,0:20:13.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we've lost so much air already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:15.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.38,0:20:19.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that? A light\Nin the darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.65,0:20:22.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that Fishman Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.32,0:20:24.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe Luffy beat us there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.35,0:20:27.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be. We haven't\Ndescended the last 3,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.39,0:20:30.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\b1}"Who are you? A friend?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:31.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\b1}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.39,0:20:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you wanna flash signals,\Ndo it without actually flashing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:35.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you tell what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.57,0:20:37.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NNo, it's still too bright to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:41.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps] Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.01,0:20:47.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An anglerfish! We're screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.28,0:20:48.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.41,0:20:51.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The deep-sea hunter fooled us,\Nhook, line, and sinker!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.02,0:20:56.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NUh! A little close that time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.45,0:20:58.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There isn't anywhere\Nleft for us to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:00.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.29,0:21:03.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[screams]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.03,0:21:06.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[whimpering]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.86,0:21:08.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:10.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's human?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.03,0:21:12.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! This doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.07,0:21:17.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A sea monster... that's\Ntaken on the form of a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.37,0:21:21.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a sea bonze!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.25,0:21:27.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NAh! He's gonna capsize the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.72,0:21:29.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[ALL screaming]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.81,0:21:31.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.92,0:21:33.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's naughty!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.53,0:21:36.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know better, Ankoro! Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.38,0:21:38.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not allowed to eat ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.80,0:21:42.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many times do\NI have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:45.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Vander Decken won't be\Nhappy when he hears about this.
Comment: 0,0:21:44.41,0:21:45.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when he hears about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.71,0:21:48.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait. Did he just help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.98,0:21:50.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who freakin' cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.18,0:21:53.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's just make a break for it!\NHe might change his mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.76,0:22:03.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}[VANDER DECKEN singing]\N♪ Dead men tell no tales,\Nand dead men have no needs...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.64,0:22:05.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[BROOK]\NIs that me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.35,0:22:08.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}[VANDER DECKEN]\NI pluck the rings\Nright off their hands
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.07,0:22:11.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}within these shadowy seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.01,0:22:16.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}Dead men have no regrets\Nand no tears left to weep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:18.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}I'll pluck the crowns\Nright off their heads
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.92,0:22:21.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}within this cold, black deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.82,0:22:24.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}Sunken treasures\Nfree for the taking!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.73,0:22:27.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}A king of pirates in the making!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.36,0:22:31.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}I leave my enemies,\Nweeping and shaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.33,0:22:36.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}Vander Decken is my name,\Nand these long-lost riches
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.34,0:22:38.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}I do claim! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:40.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\i1}[FLYING PIRATES cheer]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.91,0:22:43.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams] Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.18,0:22:48.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps] No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.40,0:22:53.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.31,0:22:57.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams] It's a ghost ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.06,0:23:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are the last one\Nwho should be scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.00,0:23:02.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't get with these\Nmoves! Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.56,0:23:05.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell us that thing isn't real!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:06.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell us it's like your ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.85,0:23:11.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing would make me happier,\Nbut take a look at their sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.33,0:23:14.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the legendary\N{\i1}Flying Dutchman{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.68,0:23:17.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be here!\NIt shouldn't exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.80,0:23:22.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As the story goes, it sailed\Nthe seas hundreds of years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.37,0:23:24.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One dark and stormy night,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.40,0:23:27.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the captain of the ship\Nsuddenly lost his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.54,0:23:30.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Consumed with madness,\Nhe threw his own crewmates
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.51,0:23:32.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,into the sea, one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.81,0:23:36.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, he turned his gaze to the\Nheavens and cursed the very gods!
Comment: 0,0:23:34.71,0:23:36.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and cursed the very gods!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.85,0:23:40.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The captain's name was none\Nother than Vander Decken,
Comment: 0,0:23:38.51,0:23:40.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,than Vander Decken,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.19,0:23:42.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the ship was\Nthe {\i1}Flying Dutchman{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.43,0:23:45.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The gods condemned\Nhim for his actions,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.45,0:23:48.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and he was cursed\Nfor all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.22,0:23:52.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sailing the seas aimlessly,\Nthere on that very vessel!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.24,0:23:54.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NEven if you're a skeleton\Nwho has sailed
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.02,0:23:56.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,on a ghost ship of your own,\Nthe sight of the {\i1}Flying Dutchman{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.86,0:23:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,will put chills down your spine!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.37,0:24:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[DECKEN]\NListen up, I'm not\Ndigging their treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.08,0:24:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,out of your stomachs,\Nso no eating the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.89,0:24:08.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just give it a good knock!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.12,0:24:11.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You betcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.22,0:24:13.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NI think we're about to get pounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.43,0:24:15.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWell, sure! He's our enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.45,0:24:17.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, we need\Na Coup de Burst! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.79,0:24:20.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NI can't! We used up\Nall our fuel already!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.70,0:24:23.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means we're on our own till\NI can restock the cola supply!
Comment: 0,0:24:21.68,0:24:23.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,till I can restock\Nthe cola supply!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.83,0:24:25.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WADATSUMI yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.64,0:24:27.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH scream]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.45,0:24:29.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.16,0:24:30.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.57,0:24:32.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.22,0:24:41.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.60,0:24:45.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[STRAW HATS yelling]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.41,0:24:46.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.08,0:24:55.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the Monster\Nof the Arctic, the Kraken.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.85,0:25:08.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAll right, he learned\Nhis lesson. Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.36,0:25:15.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NGood boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.66,0:25:20.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.00,0:25:21.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(719.5,1053)\q2}– [ALL cheer]\N– [USOPP] Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.36,0:25:23.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought you were dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.23,0:25:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was so scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.00,0:25:28.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.10,0:25:31.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-swan! Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.84,0:25:35.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was crazy, that's for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.34,0:25:37.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They got lost. Morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.95,0:25:39.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're hopeless without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.24,0:25:42.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gonna take that, Wadatsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.72,0:25:45.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get back up! Avenge yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.10,0:25:46.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Start swinging!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.54,0:25:49.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WADATSUMI groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.22,0:25:51.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NMy bubble popped\Nand so did Sanji's,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.30,0:25:55.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so we all had to crowd inside\NZoro's before we drowned!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.98,0:25:57.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were running outta air!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.49,0:25:59.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How 'bout you stop\Nscaring us like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.74,0:26:01.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now a song for you, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.98,0:26:05.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY sighs]\NFinally! I can stretch my legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.69,0:26:06.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NLuffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.92,0:26:09.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We thought you\Nwere gone forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.35,0:26:10.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[sobs]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.55,0:26:13.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you survived that,\Nyou can survive anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.19,0:26:15.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No kidding,\Nand you tamed the Kraken
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.36,0:26:18.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just like you said.\NI thought you were nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.67,0:26:21.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN laughs] So, is he\Ngoing to be our new guide?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.77,0:26:22.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.98,0:26:25.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that goopy dude can have\Na sea monster pull his ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.04,0:26:27.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then we can have\NSurume pull the {\i1}Sunny{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.01,0:26:28.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.25,0:26:30.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NOf course, you would name\Nit already, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.62,0:26:33.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK singing]\N♪ Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.92,0:26:35.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ I think our captain's insane\Nto give it such a name, ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.89,0:26:38.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ but as long as it can\Ncarry us, I won't complain! ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.02,0:26:41.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, pull the {\i1}Sunny{\i0}\Nforward. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.26,0:26:44.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NUh, that's cool if he wants\Nto give us a free ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.80,0:26:48.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But make sure he doesn't crush\Nus with those giant tentacles.
Comment: 0,0:26:46.23,0:26:48.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with those giant tentacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.10,0:26:50.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FLYING PIRATE]\NCaptain, the ship's getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.54,0:26:52.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[DECKEN]\NYou think I can't see the Kraken?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.61,0:26:53.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Follow them!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.64,0:26:55.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FLYING PIRATES]\N– Aye, aye!\N– Aye, aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.89,0:26:59.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[PIRATES gasp]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.09,0:27:00.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.15,0:27:07.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.40,0:27:10.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta turn back,\Nor we're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.09,0:27:16.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew it. An undersea\Nvolcano. Straight ahead.
Comment: 0,0:27:15.84,0:27:16.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.88,0:27:19.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}[USOPP, CHOPPER, BROOK, FRANKY]{\fs82}\N– What?\N– What?
