Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:04.98,We Go Roger Main,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR] Gold Roger,\Nthe King of the Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:07.98,We Go Roger Main,,0,0,0,,attained every treasure that\Nthe world had to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:10.72,We Go Roger Main,,0,0,0,,Smiling, even as he stood\Nupon the scaffold,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:13.09,We Go Roger Main,,0,0,0,,he issued a challenge\Nto the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:14.32,We Go Roger Main,,0,0,0,,[GOLD ROGER]\NYou want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:15.42,We Go Roger Main,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.42,0:00:18.16,We Go Roger Main,,0,0,0,,I left everything I gathered\Ntogether in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:20.53,We Go Roger Main,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:22.50,We Go Roger Main,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NNow, those who dare to dream
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.50,We Go Roger Main,,0,0,0,,hoist their flags and sail\Ninto the Great Pirate Era!
